WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.13 · Marketing & Communications
Measuring communications performance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Reach and likes are easy to count, but what matters is whether people take the action you need.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Measuring communications means checking whether people took the action you needed, not only how many saw your message. You measure at three levels: outputs, engagement and outcomes.

4
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:25.800
Three levels of measurement

5
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:34.907
Outputs and reach: What you produced, and who saw it. For example: 200 flyers handed out at the market; eight posts in the first month.

6
00:00:34.907 --> 00:00:42.163
Engagement: How people interacted with it. For example: About 40 enquiries and 60 clicks on the pre-order link.

7
00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:50.989
Outcomes: Whether people took the action you needed. For example: 12 households pre-ordered bread, against a target of 20.

8
00:00:51.389 --> 00:00:51.989
Why it matters

9
00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:56.922
1. Reach and likes are tempting but rarely the goal.

10
00:00:56.922 --> 00:01:01.485
2. Outcome measures show which efforts deserve your time.

11
00:01:01.485 --> 00:01:07.789
3. Testing one change at a time shows what really works.

12
00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:08.789
What it guides

13
00:01:08.789 --> 00:01:13.722
1. Each communication objective, with one or two outcome measures.

14
00:01:13.722 --> 00:01:18.285
2. Your MEAL routine, with monthly or quarterly reviews.

15
00:01:18.285 --> 00:01:23.478
3. Your next campaign and your content mix.

16
00:01:23.878 --> 00:01:24.478
What to avoid

17
00:01:24.478 --> 00:01:27.559
Counting likes as success.

18
00:01:27.559 --> 00:01:33.233
Launching without tracked links or “How did you hear about us?”

19
00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:39.907
Changing many things at once, so you cannot tell what worked.

20
00:01:40.507 --> 00:01:42.307
You define your communications measures and review routine.

21
00:01:42.307 --> 00:01:46.307
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

22
00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.907
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
